@page "/"

<PageTitle>Coffee Delivery</PageTitle>

<section class="hero-section">
    <div class="hero-content">
        <p class="eyebrow">Delivery de cafés especiais</p>
        <h1>Encontre o café perfeito para qualquer hora do dia</h1>
        <p class="hero-description">
            Com o Coffee Delivery você recebe seu café onde estiver, com qualidade, rapidez e sabor.
        </p>

        <div class="benefits-grid" aria-label="Benefícios do Coffee Delivery">
            <div class="benefit-item">
                <span class="benefit-icon cart" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                <span>Compra simples e segura</span>
            </div>
            <div class="benefit-item">
                <span class="benefit-icon timer" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                <span>Entrega rápida</span>
            </div>
            <div class="benefit-item">
                <span class="benefit-icon package" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                <span>Embalagem mantém o café intacto</span>
            </div>
            <div class="benefit-item">
                <span class="benefit-icon coffee" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                <span>Café fresquinho até você</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-visual" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="hero-orbit orbit-one"></span>
        <span class="hero-orbit orbit-two"></span>
        <span class="hero-bean bean-one"></span>
        <span class="hero-bean bean-two"></span>
        <span class="hero-bean bean-three"></span>
        <div class="hero-cup">
            <span class="steam steam-one"></span>
            <span class="steam steam-two"></span>
            <span class="steam steam-three"></span>
            <span class="cup-lid"></span>
            <span class="cup-body"></span>
            <span class="cup-sleeve">Coffee Delivery</span>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="coffee-section" aria-labelledby="coffee-title">
    <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">Cardápio</p>
        <h2 id="coffee-title">Nossos cafés</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="coffee-grid">
        <article class="coffee-card">
            <div class="coffee-image espresso" aria-hidden="true">
                <span class="coffee-saucer"></span>
                <span class="coffee-cup-top"></span>
                <span class="coffee-drink"></span>
            </div>
            <div class="tag-list">
                <span>Tradicional</span>
            </div>
            <h3>Expresso Tradicional</h3>
            <p>O tradicional café feito com água quente e grãos moídos na hora.</p>
            <div class="coffee-footer">
                <strong>R$ 9,90</strong>
                @* Futuramente este botão adicionará o café ao carrinho. *@
                <button type="button">Adicionar</button>
            </div>
        </article>

        <article class="coffee-card">
            <div class="coffee-image americano" aria-hidden="true">
                <span class="coffee-saucer"></span>
                <span class="coffee-cup-top"></span>
                <span class="coffee-drink"></span>
            </div>
            <div class="tag-list">
                <span>Tradicional</span>
            </div>
            <h3>Americano</h3>
            <p>Expresso diluído, menos intenso e perfeito para acompanhar o dia.</p>
            <div class="coffee-footer">
                <strong>R$ 10,90</strong>
                <button type="button">Adicionar</button>
            </div>
        </article>

        <article class="coffee-card">
            <div class="coffee-image cappuccino" aria-hidden="true">
                <span class="coffee-saucer"></span>
                <span class="coffee-cup-top"></span>
                <span class="coffee-drink"></span>
            </div>
            <div class="tag-list">
                <span>Com leite</span>
            </div>
            <h3>Cappuccino</h3>
            <p>Café com leite cremoso, espuma macia e um toque de chocolate.</p>
            <div class="coffee-footer">
                <strong>R$ 14,90</strong>
                <button type="button">Adicionar</button>
            </div>
        </article>

        <article class="coffee-card">
            <div class="coffee-image latte" aria-hidden="true">
                <span class="coffee-saucer"></span>
                <span class="coffee-cup-top"></span>
                <span class="coffee-drink"></span>
            </div>
            <div class="tag-list">
                <span>Com leite</span>
                <span>Suave</span>
            </div>
            <h3>Latte</h3>
            <p>Uma combinação leve de café expresso e leite vaporizado.</p>
            <div class="coffee-footer">
                <strong>R$ 13,90</strong>
                <button type="button">Adicionar</button>
            </div>
        </article>
    </div>
</section>
